### ===== NOTES IN PROJECT =====

### Get all notes in project
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/3/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get pinned notes
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes?pinned=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get favourite notes
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes?favourite=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get single note
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create note w projekcie
POST http://localhost:3000/projects/3/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "title": "Moja notatka w projekcie",
  "content": "Treść notatki"
}

### Update note
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "title": "Zmieniony tytuł"
}

### Delete note
DELETE http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Toggle pin
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes/1/pin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Toggle favourite
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes/1/favourite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== NOTE ACCESS MANAGEMENT =====

### Lista członków notatki
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nadaj dostęp (VIEW)
POST http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "userId": 5
}

### Nadaj dostęp (EDIT)
POST http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "userId": 5,
  "accessLevel": "EDIT"
}

### Nadaj dostęp (DELETE)
POST http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "userId": 5,
  "accessLevel": "DELETE"
}

### Odbierz dostęp
DELETE http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes/1/members/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== TESTY BEZPIECZENSTWA =====

### Brak tokenu → 401
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/1/notes

### Brak dostępu do projektu → 403
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/999/notes/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Toggle favourite bez dostępu → 403
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/999/notes/999/favourite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nadanie dostępu bez bycia ownerem → 403
POST http://localhost:3000/projects/999/notes/999/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "userId": 3
}